<title>JAPAN: Konoshima to be listed on OSE 2nd section.</title>
<headline>Konoshima to be listed on OSE 2nd section.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA, Japan 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) said on Thursday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry to list shares of Konoshima Chemical Co Ltd on the second section of the exchange.</p>
<p>The listing was expected to take place on December 11, the OSE said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company will issue 1.2 million new shares through a public offering, the OSE said. The payment date is December 10, it added.</p>
